! IRIX 6.5 colour schemes for mwc's ~/.config/mwc/mwmrc.
! Values: BaseColorPalette at gamma 1.0 (gamma1_0.WMActiveBackground and WMBackground),
! from the palettes in techomancer/ttr (data/schemes/irix). docs/irix-schemes.html shows
! them as mwc draws them; after a change here, make schemes writes it anew.
!
! Use: copy a scheme's two Mwm lines into mwmrc, without the leading "! ". Base
! (= IndigoMagic) is active here. Later lines win, so a scheme further down overrides it.
! mwc's built-in default is Base with its optional black foreground.
!
! Title text: deliberately unset. 4Dwm left it to Motif and so does mwc: black above 70%
! brightness, white otherwise. Where the palette says otherwise, an optional override is
! at the bottom.
!
! The global colours reach programs with frame colours of their own: a global
! activeForeground is their title text too, and unfocused they are mixed with background.
!
! rootBackground is not part of the schemes (IRIX: Customize > Background).
! Without it the desktop keeps mwc's default #5b7792.
! Mwm*rootBackground:          #5b7792

! --- Arizona
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #968d4f
! Mwm*background:              #868373

! --- Base  (= IndigoMagic, active)
Mwm*activeBackground:        #c6c1aa
Mwm*background:              #aaaaaa

! --- Bayou
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #b69dab
! Mwm*background:              #878787

! --- BlackAndWhite
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #000000
! Mwm*background:              #ffffff

! --- Buckingham
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #9991a6
! Mwm*background:              #8c8c8c

! --- Gainsborough
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #aea9c2
! Mwm*background:              #8c8c8c

! --- Gotham
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #aba68c
! Mwm*background:              #8c8c8c

! --- GrayScale
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #d6d6d6
! Mwm*background:              #c1c1c1

! --- Inverness
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #b7a5d0
! Mwm*background:              #9ca3c2

! --- KeyWest
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #e3a6a6
! Mwm*background:              #d3b5b5

! --- Lascaux  (colours as Base)
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #c6c1aa
! Mwm*background:              #aaaaaa

! --- Leonardo  (colours as Bayou)
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #b69dab
! Mwm*background:              #878787

! --- Mendocino
