! --- RedGreenSafe  (colours as Gainsborough)
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #aea9c2
! Mwm*background:              #8c8c8c

! --- Rembrandt  (colours as Mendocino)
! Mwm*activeBackground:        #44848c
! Mwm*background:              #718c91

! --- Rio
