! === Optional: title text as the palette has it, where it differs from Motif's
! Only together with its scheme. No comment after the value: in mwmrc a "!" after the
! value is still part of it.
! --- Base
!   foreground: Motif gives #ffffff
! Mwm*foreground:             #000000
! --- Gainsborough
!   activeForeground: Motif gives #ffffff
! Mwm*activeForeground:       #000000
!   foreground: Motif gives #ffffff
! Mwm*foreground:             #000000
